#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
" The Qiskit SDK provides ways to convert between OpenQASM and the "
"[`QuantumCircuit`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit) class (see "
"[OpenQASM 2 and Qiskit](interoperate-qiskit-qasm2) and [OpenQASM 3 and "
"Qiskit](interoperate-qiskit-qasm3) for instructions).  \n"
msgstr ""
" Qiskit SDK menyediakan cara untuk mengonversi antara OpenQASM dan kelas "
"[`QuantumCircuit`](../api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit) (lihat "
"[OpenQASM 2 dan Qiskit](interoperate-qiskit-qasm2) dan [OpenQASM 3 dan "
"Qiskit](interoperate-qiskit-qasm3) untuk petunjuknya).\n"

